# No Dev Defaults in the Platform

`charts/zelkor-platform/`, `images/`, and `agents/` ship to customers. Kind/dev convenience lives only in `profiles/values-local.yaml` (and example `values-local.yaml`).

## What must not appear as a shipped default

| Kind of value | Examples | Allowed only in |
|---|---|---|
| Local hosts | `*.localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, `host.docker.internal` | local profile, tests env, quickstart (kind path) |
| Unsigned / local auth | `dev-key`, `dev:` prefix, `devTokens.enabled: true`, `trustTenantHeader: true` | local profile |
| Local secrets | `zelkor-dev-password`, `admin@zelkor.local`, baked Langfuse `pk-lf-zelkor-dev-*` | local profile |
| Kind-only topology | `hostNetwork: true` as chart default, `kind-zelkor` | local profile / install.sh overlay |
| Demo / lab tenants | `Bank_Alpha`, `Squad_Alpha`, fixture org ids | overlay or tests |

Knobs are fine (`auth.devTokens.enabled: false`, `gateway.hosts.*: ""`). **Literals that make local kind work without an overlay are not.**

## While implementing

1. New Helm values default to empty, `false`, or a generic production-safe string — never a laptop/kind value.
2. Templates: no `| default "ai-gateway.localhost"` (or any row above). Use `required` or omit the field when empty.
3. Image / agent Python: `os.getenv("X", "")` — not `os.getenv("X", "http://mcp.localhost")` or `"dev-key"`.
4. `install.sh` applies `profiles/values-local.yaml`; it does not write those values into the chart.
5. Enabling unsigned tokens, trusting `X-Tenant-ID`, or pointing at Docker Desktop is an **overlay**, not a chart or image default.

```yaml
# BAD — kind host in the production chart
hosts:
  aiGateway: "ai-gateway.localhost"
# BAD
Host: {{ .Values.gateway.hosts.aiGateway | default "ai-gateway.localhost" }}

# GOOD
hosts:
  aiGateway: ""
```

## After each substantial implementation

Diff `values.yaml`, `templates/`, `files/`, `images/`, `agents/` and ask: **would this default still be correct on a customer cluster with no kind overlay?**

- [ ] No new `*.localhost` / `host.docker.internal` / `127.0.0.1` as chart or image default
- [ ] `devTokens` / `trustTenantHeader` still default off; no `dev-key` / `dev:` in chart or images
- [ ] No new passwords, Langfuse lab keys, or `admin@zelkor.local` in `values.yaml`
- [ ] New knobs are empty/off; local values landed in `profiles/values-local.yaml` only

